WEBVTT

00:08:28.963 --> 00:08:33.425
to share it with somebody
who was genuinely curious and interested.

00:08:34.051 --> 00:08:35.261
By the end of the day,

00:08:35.261 --> 00:08:39.640
Don and I looked
very different to one another.

00:08:40.182 --> 00:08:41.559
And this drawing,

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:44.228
which ended up in my visual column
in the New York Times

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:46.647
or as Don likes to call it,
the fake-news media --

00:08:46.689 --> 00:08:49.775
(Laughter)

00:08:49.817 --> 00:08:54.530
now hangs framed on the wall
of his big game trophy room.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:56.615
(Laughter)

00:08:56.657 --> 00:09:00.452
(Applause)